flowchart TD
    A([Pending authorization change])
    --> B[Administrator clicks Sync Now]
    --> C{Sync already requested?}

    C -- Yes --> D[Show existing synchronization status]
    --> E([No duplicate request])

    C -- No --> F[Submit synchronization request]
    --> G[Status = Processing]
    --> H[Apply pending authorization state]
    --> I{Successful?}

    I -- Yes --> J[Status = Completed]
    I -- No --> K[Status = Failed]
